<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Lingueo — Road to Scale · Constat S1 & Plan d'action H2</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --blue-900:#0D2570; --blue-700:#1B41A8; --blue-500:#3360D4; --blue-300:#8AA4ED; --blue-100:#DBE4FA; --blue-50:#EEF2FD;
  --yellow-500:#FFCE00; --yellow-300:#FFE266; --yellow-100:#FFF5C2;
  --green-500:#21B574; --green-100:#D4F2E2;
  --coral-500:#FF6B5A; --coral-100:#FFE0DC;
  --violet-500:#6E5AE8; --violet-100:#E3DDFB;
  --ink-1000:#0A0E1F; --ink-900:#161B2E; --ink-700:#3D4458; --ink-500:#6B7287; --ink-300:#B7BCCB; --ink-200:#DDE1EB; --ink-100:#ECEFF5; --ink-50:#F5F7FB; --white:#FFFFFF;
  --ease-out:cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1); --ease-spring:cubic-bezier(0.34,1.56,0.64,1);
}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;color:var(--ink-900);background:var(--ink-50);line-height:1.6;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
h1,h2,h3,h4,.display{font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif}
.mono{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace}

/* ---------- NAV ---------- */
.nav{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100;background:rgba(13,37,112,.92);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08)}
.nav-inner{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:14px 40px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
.nav-brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;color:#fff;font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans';font-weight:800;font-size:18px;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.nav-brand .dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--yellow-500)}
.nav-links{display:flex;gap:6px}
.nav-links a{color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);text-decoration:none;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:999px;transition:all .2s var(--ease-out)}
.nav-links a:hover{color:#fff;background:rgba(255,255,255,.12)}
@media(max-width:760px){.nav-links{display:none}}

/* ---------- HERO ---------- */
.hero{position:relative;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0D2570 0%,#1B41A8 55%,#3360D4 100%);color:#fff;overflow:hidden;padding:84px 40px 96px}
.hero::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:-40%;right:-10%;width:680px;height:680px;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(255,206,0,.18),transparent 62%);border-radius:50%}
.hero::after{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:-30%;left:-8%;width:520px;height:520px;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(51,96,212,.5),transparent 60%);border-radius:50%}
.hero-inner{position:relative;max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;z-index:2}
.eyebrow{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);padding:7px 16px;border-radius:999px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase}
.eyebrow .pulse{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--yellow-500);box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(255,206,0,.6);animation:pulse 2s infinite}
@keyframes pulse{0%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(255,206,0,.55)}70%{box-shadow:0 0 0 12px rgba(255,206,0,0)}100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(255,206,0,0)}}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(38px,5.4vw,66px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin:22px 0 18px;max-width:18ch}
.hero h1 .hl{color:var(--yellow-500)}
.hero .lead{font-size:clamp(17px,1.8vw,21px);color:rgba(255,255,255,.82);max-width:60ch;line-height:1.6}
.hero-meta{display:flex;gap:28px;margin-top:32px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.hero-meta div{font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.6)}
.hero-meta b{display:block;color:#fff;font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans';font-weight:700;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:2px}

/* ---------- LAYOUT ---------- */
.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px}
.section{padding:72px 0}
.section-head{margin-bottom:40px;max-width:62ch}
.tag{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--blue-500);margin-bottom:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
.tag .num{width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--blue-700);color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans';font-size:13px}
.section h2{font-size:clamp(27px,3vw,38px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.025em;line-height:1.12;color:var(--ink-900)}
.section h2 .hl{color:var(--blue-700)}
.section .intro{font-size:18px;color:var(--ink-700);margin-top:14px;line-height:1.6}

/* ---------- KPI BANNER ---------- */
.kpi-band{background:var(--white);border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 24px 60px -28px rgba(13,37,112,.35);padding:8px;margin-top:-56px;position:relative;z-index:5;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}
.kpi{padding:26px 22px;position:relative}
.kpi:not(:last-child)::after{content:'';position:absolute;right:0;top:22%;height:56%;width:1px;background:var(--ink-200)}
.kpi .k-val{font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans';font-weight:800;font-size:38px;letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1;color:var(--blue-700)}
.kpi .k-val.alert{color:var(--coral-500)}
.kpi .k-val.warn{color:#E0820B}
.kpi .k-lbl{font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-500);margin-top:8px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.4}
.kpi .k-sub{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.04em;margin-top:6px;text-transform:uppercase}
.k-sub.dn{color:var(--coral-500)} .k-sub.up{color:var(--green-500)}
@media(max-width:880px){.kpi-band{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.kpi:nth-child(2)::after{display:none}}
@media(max-width:480px){.kpi-band{grid-template-columns:1fr}.kpi::after{display:none!important}}

/* ---------- ACTIVITY TABLE ---------- */
.act-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr;gap:28px;align-items:start}
@media(max-width:880px){.act-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.card{background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--ink-200);border-radius:20px;padding:28px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px -22px rgba(13,37,112,.3)}
.card h3{font-size:18px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px;color:var(--ink-900)}
.card .csub{font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-500);margin-bottom:20px}
.rep{margin-bottom:18px}
.rep:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
.rep-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:6px}
.rep-name{font-weight:700;font-size:15px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px}
.rep-name .ini{width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:7px;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#fff;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans'}
.rep-fig{font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-500)}
.rep-fig b{color:var(--ink-900);font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans';font-size:15px}
.bar{height:9px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--ink-100);overflow:hidden}
.bar span{display:block;height:100%;border-radius:999px;width:0;transition:width 1.1s var(--ease-out)}
.barscale{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-300);margin-top:6px;text-align:right}

.src-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:13px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ink-100)}
.src-row:last-child{border-bottom:none}
.src-ico{width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:11px;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none;font-size:18px}
.src-mid{flex:1}
.src-name{font-weight:600;font-size:14px}
.src-bar{height:7px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--ink-100);margin-top:6px;overflow:hidden}
.src-bar span{display:block;height:100%;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue-500);width:0;transition:width 1s var(--ease-out)}
.src-val{font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans';font-weight:800;font-size:20px;color:var(--blue-700);flex:none}
.src-val small{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-400);font-weight:500}

/* ---------- MIX RENEW/NB ---------- */
.mix-wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px;margin-top:8px}
@media(max-width:760px){.mix-wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.mix-card{background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--ink-200);border-radius:20px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px -22px rgba(13,37,112,.3)}
.mix-card .yr{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-500);margin-bottom:16px}
.mix-card.now .yr{color:var(--blue-700)}
.mixbar{display:flex;height:46px;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#fff}
.mixbar .seg{display:grid;place-items:center;transition:flex .9s var(--ease-out)}
.seg.renew{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1B41A8,#3360D4)}
.seg.nb{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#21B574,#1a9b62)}
.mix-leg{display:flex;gap:18px;margin-top:14px;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-500)}
.mix-leg span{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
.mix-leg i{width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:3px;display:inline-block}
.mix-note{margin-top:18px;font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-700);line-height:1.55;background:var(--blue-50);border-left:3px solid var(--blue-500);padding:12px 16px;border-radius:0 10px 10px 0}
.mix-note b{color:var(--blue-900)}

/* ---------- PROBLEMS ---------- */
.prob-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(255px,1fr));gap:18px}
.prob{background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--ink-200);border-radius:18px;padding:24px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;transition:transform .3s var(--ease-out),box-shadow .3s var(--ease-out)}
.prob:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 18px 40px -24px rgba(13,37,112,.4)}
.prob::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:4px;background:var(--coral-500)}
.prob .pico{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--coral-100);display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:22px;margin-bottom:14px}
.prob h4{font-size:16px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px;color:var(--ink-900)}
.prob p{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-700);line-height:1.55}
.prob .fix{margin-top:12px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--blue-700);font-weight:600;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:7px}
.prob .fix::before{content:'→';font-weight:800}

/* ---------- TURN / move justification ---------- */
.turn{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0D2570,#1B41A8);border-radius:26px;padding:46px 44px;color:#fff;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.turn::after{content:'';position:absolute;right:-60px;top:-60px;width:280px;height:280px;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(255,206,0,.16),transparent 65%);border-radius:50%}
.turn h2{color:#fff;position:relative}
.turn .intro{color:rgba(255,255,255,.82);position:relative}
.turn-moves{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:16px;margin-top:30px;position:relative}
.move{background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);border-radius:16px;padding:20px}
.move .mn{font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans';font-weight:800;font-size:14px;color:var(--yellow-500);margin-bottom:8px}
.move p{font-size:13.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.85);line-height:1.5}

/* ---------- ROADMAP ---------- */
.road{position:relative}
.month{position:relative;margin-bottom:30px}
.month-card{background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--ink-200);border-radius:22px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 36px -26px rgba(13,37,112,.4)}
.month-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;padding:24px 30px;color:#fff;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.month-head.m6{background:linear-gradient(120deg,#1B41A8,#3360D4)}
.month-head.m7{background:linear-gradient(120deg,#0D2570,#1B41A8)}
.month-head.m8{background:linear-gradient(120deg,#6E5AE8,#3360D4)}
.month-num{font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans';font-weight:800;font-size:46px;line-height:1;opacity:.9}
.month-tt{flex:1}
.month-tt .mlabel{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.8}
.month-tt h3{font-size:23px;font-weight:800;margin-top:3px;color:#fff}
.month-theme{font-size:13px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.16);padding:7px 15px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap}
.month-body{padding:26px 30px}
.act-list{display:grid;gap:13px}
.act-item{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start}
.act-item .ck{width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:7px;background:var(--blue-50);border:1.5px solid var(--blue-300);flex:none;margin-top:1px;display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--blue-700);font-size:12px;font-weight:800}
.act-item .atxt{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--ink-700);line-height:1.5}
.act-item .atxt b{color:var(--ink-900);font-weight:700}
.act-axis{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.05em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--blue-500);display:inline-block;margin-top:2px}
.obj{margin-top:24px;background:var(--ink-50);border-radius:16px;padding:22px 24px;border:1px dashed var(--ink-300)}
.obj-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans';font-weight:800;font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-900);margin-bottom:14px}
.obj-head .flag{width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:7px;background:var(--yellow-500);display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:13px}
.obj-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:14px}
.obj-kpi{background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--ink-200);border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px}
.obj-kpi .ov{font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans';font-weight:800;font-size:24px;color:var(--green-500);line-height:1}
.obj-kpi .ol{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-500);margin-top:6px;line-height:1.35}

/* ---------- FINAL ---------- */
.final{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FFCE00,#FFE266);border-radius:26px;padding:46px 44px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;text-align:center}
.final h2{color:var(--blue-900);font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,34px)}
.final p{color:var(--blue-900);opacity:.85;font-size:17px;max-width:60ch;margin:14px auto 0;line-height:1.6}
.final .sig{margin-top:24px;font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans';font-weight:700;color:var(--blue-700);font-size:14px}

.foot{background:var(--ink-1000);color:rgba(255,255,255,.55);font-size:12px;padding:22px 40px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}
.foot b{color:var(--yellow-500)}

/* reveal */
.reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px);transition:opacity .7s var(--ease-out),transform .7s var(--ease-out)}
.reveal.in{opacity:1;transform:none}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav class="nav">
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <div class="nav-brand"><span class="dot"></span>Lingueo · Road to Scale</div>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#constat">Constat S1</a>
      <a href="#activite">Activité</a>
      <a href="#freins">Freins</a>
      <a href="#moves">Les moves</a>
      <a href="#plan">Plan Juin–Août</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<header class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <span class="eyebrow"><span class="pulse"></span>Direction commerciale · Bilan S1 2026 & cap S2</span>
    <h1>Le marché converge vers nous.<br><span class="hl">À nous de convertir.</span></h1>
    <p class="lead">Notre positionnement est rare et défendable. Ce qui bloque n'est ni le produit ni le marché : c'est l'exécution commerciale, l'acquisition et nos moyens internes. Voici le constat chiffré du S1 — et le plan pour préparer septembre.</p>
    <div class="hero-meta">
      <div><b>3 commerciaux</b>analysés sur 2026</div>
      <div><b>229 RDV</b>dont 167 prospects</div>
      <div><b>696 k€</b>de PO · NB + Renew</div>
      <div><b>Juin → Août</b>3 mois pour armer S2</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="wrap">
  <div class="kpi-band reveal" id="constat">
    <div class="kpi">
      <div class="k-val">167</div>
      <div class="k-lbl">RDV prospects pris sur 2026 (sur 229 RDV au total)</div>
      <div class="k-sub up">≈ 73 % orientés prospect</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi">
      <div class="k-val warn">9,2</div>
      <div class="k-lbl">RDV prospects / commercial / mois en moyenne</div>
      <div class="k-sub dn">Trop dépendant d'1 seule personne</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi">
      <div class="k-val alert">50/50</div>
      <div class="k-lbl">Mix New Business / Renew sur le PO</div>
      <div class="k-sub dn">vs 30/70 l'an dernier</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi">
      <div class="k-val">63 %</div>
      <div class="k-lbl">des RDV viennent du téléphone — 1 seul canal porteur</div>
      <div class="k-sub dn">Acquisition quasi absente</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ACTIVITÉ -->
<section class="section" id="activite">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <div class="tag"><span class="num">1</span>Ce que disent les chiffres</div>
      <h2>Une activité réelle, mais <span class="hl">portée par trop peu de monde</span> et un seul canal</h2>
      <p class="intro">Le volume existe. Mais il repose sur un commercial pour près de la moitié des RDV prospects, et 6 RDV sur 10 viennent du seul téléphone. La machine tourne sur une jambe.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="act-grid">
      <div class="card reveal">
        <h3>Volume de RDV prospects par commercial</h3>
        <div class="csub">Année 2026 · onglet Suivi prise de RDV</div>

        <div class="rep">
          <div class="rep-top">
            <span class="rep-name"><span class="ini" style="background:#1B41A8">R</span>Rony</span>
            <span class="rep-fig"><b>84</b> RDV prospects · 118 total · 14/mois</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bar"><span data-w="100" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#1B41A8,#3360D4)"></span></div>
        </div>

        <div class="rep">
          <div class="rep-top">
            <span class="rep-name"><span class="ini" style="background:#3360D4">G</span>Genia</span>
            <span class="rep-fig"><b>53</b> RDV prospects · 71 total · 8,7/mois</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bar"><span data-w="63" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#3360D4,#8AA4ED)"></span></div>
        </div>

        <div class="rep">
          <div class="rep-top">
            <span class="rep-name"><span class="ini" style="background:#8AA4ED">S</span>Sarah</span>
            <span class="rep-fig"><b>30</b> RDV prospects · 40 total · 5/mois</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bar"><span data-w="36" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#8AA4ED,#DBE4FA)"></span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="barscale">Base 100 = meilleur performeur (Rony)</div>

        <div class="mix-note" style="margin-top:22px">À eux trois, un taux de focus prospect homogène et sain (<b>71 à 75 %</b>). Le problème n'est pas l'intention — c'est que <b>Rony pèse à lui seul la moitié</b> des RDV prospects. Si demain il ralentit, le pipe s'effondre.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card reveal">
        <h3>D'où viennent les RDV</h3>
        <div class="csub">Top 3 des sources · 2026</div>

        <div class="src-row">
          <div class="src-ico" style="background:var(--blue-100)">📞</div>
          <div class="src-mid">
            <div class="src-name">Téléphone</div>
            <div class="src-bar"><span data-w="100"></span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="src-val">144<small> rdv</small></div>
        </div>

        <div class="src-row">
          <div class="src-ico" style="background:var(--green-100)">✉️</div>
          <div class="src-mid">
            <div class="src-name">Mail</div>
            <div class="src-bar"><span data-w="24"></span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="src-val">34<small> rdv</small></div>
        </div>

        <div class="src-row">
          <div class="src-ico" style="background:var(--yellow-100)">🪣</div>
          <div class="src-mid">
            <div class="src-name">Bucket List</div>
            <div class="src-bar"><span data-w="10"></span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="src-val">15<small> rdv</small></div>
        </div>

        <div class="mix-note" style="margin-top:20px">Le téléphone fait <b>63 %</b> du total. Aucun canal entrant (SEO, webinaire, contenu) n'apparaît. <b>L'acquisition est à construire</b> — c'est exactement là qu'on doit créer un second moteur.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- MIX PO -->
    <div class="section-head reveal" style="margin-top:56px">
      <h2>Le signal d'alerte : <span class="hl">le renew ne nous porte plus</span></h2>
      <p class="intro">696 k€ de PO, mais la structure a basculé. On compense un renew en recul par du New Business — preuve que la base installée se fatigue et qu'il faut sécuriser les deux moteurs à la fois.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mix-wrap">
      <div class="mix-card reveal">
